"""Curated event records for results/incidents.csv (2026-10-16).

One record per event of data/incidents/universe.json. Facts come from the research notes in
data/incidents/research/batch_*.json (each fact there carries a verbatim quote) and from chain data
(data/incidents/onchain_summary.json). Decisions taken here, not in the notes:
- failure class re-coded where a note's class did not match the definitions in results/incidents.md
  (E06 S->D, E45 S->D; listed in each record's notes);
- release side "both" for an unbacked mint later redeemed against an escrow (E11, E64);
- amount_usd basis, in order of preference: our chain measurement of all legs at DefiLlama prices
  of the first release; documented released quantities times DefiLlama prices; the operator's
  figure; the press or analyst consensus; DefiLlama.
Source strings are "<kind>: <url>" with kind onchain, postmortem (the operator's own material:
post-mortem, incident report, official post, repository) or press (news media, analysts, academic
papers, data aggregators). No addresses or transaction hashes appear in this file.
"""

